WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Why can you smell cooking from another room?

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:09.190
Everything is made of tiny particles, far too small to see.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.050
Particles from the food escape into the air.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:17.380
They spread out and drift to your nose.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.013
That's how the smell travels.
